### Optimistic lock / StaleStateException — eşzamanlı product güncelleme
POST http://localhost:7070/api/products/{{productId}}/test-concurrent-update?quantity1=20&quantity2=15
Content-Type: application/json

### Pessimistic lock — eşzamanlı order status (order PENDING olmalı)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/orders/{{orderId}}/test-concurrent-pessimistic-update?status1=CONFIRMED&status2=PROCESSING
Content-Type: application/json

### MultipleBagFetchException — iki List aynı sorguda fetch
GET http://localhost:7070/api/users/{{userId}}/test-multiple-bag-fetch

